4. KEY CONVERSION PATTERNS (from DMS)
--------------------------------------
- Schema: [dbo] -> productmanagement_dbo
- IDENTITY(1,1) -> GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY (START WITH 1 INCREMENT BY 1)
- GETDATE() -> clock_timestamp()
- nvarchar(n) -> VARCHAR(n)
- datetime -> TIMESTAMP WITHOUT TIME ZONE
- bit -> BOOLEAN
- SCOPE_IDENTITY() -> RETURNING clause
- ORDER BY col -> ORDER BY col NULLS FIRST
- LEFT JOIN -> LEFT OUTER JOIN
- DECLARE @var TYPE -> DECLARE var_name TYPE
- BEGIN TRANSACTION/COMMIT -> DO $$ BEGIN...END $$;
- CREATE OR ALTER PROCEDURE -> CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION
- SYSTEM_USER -> CURRENT_USER
- IF NOT EXISTS (sys.objects) -> IF NOT EXISTS / DROP IF EXISTS

