7. MANUAL INTERVENTIONS
------------------------
Statement 3 (InsertProductAsync):
- DMS Error: "Metadata model creation failed: Statement definition is not valid."
- Reason: DMS could not parse the complex multi-statement block with
  DECLARE, SCOPE_IDENTITY(), and SELECT @variable
- Manual Conversion: Applied lowercase schema object names, replaced
  SCOPE_IDENTITY() with RETURNING clause, GETDATE() with clock_timestamp(),
  wrapped in DO $$ ... END $$ block

Statements 4-5 (Update/Delete transaction blocks):
- DMS successfully converted but noted [7807 - Severity CRITICAL]:
  "PostgreSQL does not support explicit transaction management commands
  such as BEGIN TRAN, SAVE TRAN in functions."
- Adaptation: Wrapped in DO $$ ... END $$ anonymous blocks for ADO.NET execution

